  "howToEdit": [
    "This file controls the words ValueLens shows for SEC tags and model keys. It never changes a number.",
    "Edit a label on the right-hand side, keep the key on the left exactly as it is, then rebuild; the test suite checks the file.",
    "Adding a tag here does NOT make the app read it — that is the concept map (Concepts.kt / tags.py), which goes through review.",
    "tags: XBRL tag -> what it is. concepts: the app's own line items. inputs: numbers a model uses.",
    "inputsByMetric: a label for a key that means something different inside one metric (revenue is a growth rate in Stage-1 growth).",
    "formulaTerms: abbreviations that only appear in formulas. properNouns: first words that keep their capital mid-sentence."
  ],
